WEBVTT

00:00.760 --> 00:03.560
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

00:03.560 --> 00:06.150
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

00:06.820 --> 00:10.220
♪Release and find wider shores♪

00:11.920 --> 00:14.930
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

00:15.300 --> 00:17.830
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

00:18.170 --> 00:21.610
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

00:23.360 --> 00:28.580
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

00:29.260 --> 00:34.340
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

00:35.140 --> 00:37.630
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

00:37.630 --> 00:40.240
♪Through wandering exile♪

00:40.760 --> 00:48.020
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

00:48.990 --> 00:51.750
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

00:51.810 --> 00:54.650
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

00:54.940 --> 00:55.970
♪Let me♪

00:56.160 --> 01:00.240
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

01:00.690 --> 01:03.370
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

01:03.660 --> 01:06.360
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

01:06.530 --> 01:08.000
♪Hands held tight♪

01:08.000 --> 01:12.170
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

01:12.530 --> 01:22.780
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

01:24.210 --> 01:29.760
=Legend of The Female General=

01:29.960 --> 01:32.900
=Episode 13=

02:10.169 --> 02:11.410
I'm exhausted.

02:13.850 --> 02:16.610
You slept for a full day,
so you are exhausted.

02:19.090 --> 02:20.610
Xiao Jue, you're still here?

02:23.690 --> 02:24.370
No.

02:25.650 --> 02:26.250
Commander.

02:39.210 --> 02:39.810
No need.

02:39.810 --> 02:40.170
I will

02:40.210 --> 02:41.290
take it all at once.

02:41.650 --> 02:42.370
Cheng Lisu said

02:42.610 --> 02:43.570
it works best when hot.

02:48.570 --> 02:49.170
Commander.

02:49.450 --> 02:50.290
Mr. Shen is here.

02:54.490 --> 02:55.010
Let him in.

03:07.850 --> 03:08.490
Mr. Shen.

03:09.490 --> 03:10.010
Commander.

03:10.450 --> 03:11.410
As the chief instructor,

03:12.050 --> 03:13.490
I hesitated in making decisions,

03:13.770 --> 03:14.810
which cost us the chance.

03:15.090 --> 03:16.210
Hu Yuanzhong led

03:16.210 --> 03:16.970
the Liehe men

03:17.170 --> 03:18.690
to kill a dozen new recruits.

03:19.450 --> 03:20.450
I don't want your mercy

03:21.090 --> 03:22.610
but your punishment.

03:23.690 --> 03:25.730
Commander,
Mr. Shen fulfilled his duties.

03:25.890 --> 03:26.650
What's his fault?

03:27.250 --> 03:30.250
Hu Yuanzhong is too cunning
and Lei Hou is too deceptive.

03:30.490 --> 03:31.370
How could we defend?

03:31.890 --> 03:32.610
By that logic,

03:33.690 --> 03:34.850
I should be punished.

03:35.250 --> 03:35.970
No, Commander.

03:36.210 --> 03:37.329
I failed your trust.

03:37.850 --> 03:38.530
Moreover, He Yan

03:38.770 --> 03:39.610
had given me

03:39.650 --> 03:40.490
the defense layout.

03:40.930 --> 03:41.770
But I still...

03:43.890 --> 03:44.770
Defense layout?

04:03.040 --> 04:05.030
(Defense Layout)

04:07.250 --> 04:07.970
You may leave.

04:10.210 --> 04:10.980
Yes.

04:16.190 --> 04:18.410
(Defense Layout)

04:38.450 --> 04:39.210
Explain.

04:53.090 --> 04:53.930
Commander.

05:08.890 --> 05:11.090
I was framed for murder

05:11.450 --> 05:12.730
and thrown in jail.

05:13.810 --> 05:16.010
You weren't at Yezhou Garrison.

05:16.450 --> 05:17.610
If something had happened,

05:17.770 --> 05:19.090
we would've been in danger.

05:19.890 --> 05:21.530
So I drew a map

05:21.810 --> 05:22.730
and had Miss Song

05:23.370 --> 05:24.890
deliver it to Mr. Shen.

05:28.850 --> 05:29.730
Great layout.

05:30.170 --> 05:32.210
Quite detailed.

05:37.570 --> 05:39.370
After all, I've been

05:39.730 --> 05:41.250
at Yezhou Garrison for half a year.

05:41.570 --> 05:42.290
I know the place

05:42.409 --> 05:43.530
quite well.

05:47.490 --> 05:49.010
Bring any new recruit here

05:49.409 --> 05:50.120
and guess

05:50.650 --> 05:51.850
if he can make

05:51.890 --> 05:52.890
this defense layout?

06:01.730 --> 06:02.570
My memory is perfect.

06:02.650 --> 06:03.410
I'm gifted.

06:08.370 --> 06:09.210
You're lying again.

06:09.250 --> 06:09.770
Right?

06:12.010 --> 06:12.530
Commander.

06:12.770 --> 06:13.930
You always doubt me.

06:14.130 --> 06:15.530
At least, show me some proof.

06:15.930 --> 06:17.970
You've kept me by your side for long

06:18.250 --> 06:19.170
and only discovered

06:19.770 --> 06:20.650
my loyalty, quick wit,

06:20.690 --> 06:21.570
courage, and wisdom.

06:21.810 --> 06:22.650
Anything else?

06:22.770 --> 06:23.850
Nothing.

06:27.570 --> 06:28.290
Commander,

06:29.130 --> 06:30.010
a true leader

06:30.410 --> 06:31.890
rewards and punishes people fairly.

06:32.130 --> 06:33.570
I helped resolve

06:33.610 --> 06:34.610
Yezhou Garrison's crisis.

06:34.810 --> 06:35.650
That's a merit.

06:36.090 --> 06:38.370
Shouldn't you reward me?

06:39.010 --> 06:39.650
Reward?

06:40.770 --> 06:41.770
What reward do you want?

06:45.890 --> 06:47.130
Can I join the battalion?

06:53.730 --> 06:55.650
You're being unfair?

06:55.690 --> 06:56.360
Approved.

06:59.170 --> 06:59.770
Really?

07:02.370 --> 07:03.010
Thank you.

07:03.130 --> 07:03.730
Don't worry.

07:03.850 --> 07:05.490
I'll lead the battalion well.

07:09.330 --> 07:10.530
What makes you think

07:10.970 --> 07:12.850
you can lead the battalion?

07:14.770 --> 07:15.770
I believe I was born

07:15.810 --> 07:16.970
to be a general.

07:17.570 --> 07:19.090
Sometimes, I even feel

07:19.770 --> 07:21.370
I was a female general in my past life.

07:26.650 --> 07:27.690
Don't you believe me?

07:28.530 --> 07:29.650
Or do you think

07:30.330 --> 07:31.410
women can't be generals?

07:37.730 --> 07:38.370
In this world,

07:39.730 --> 07:41.290
whether men or women,

07:42.170 --> 07:43.170
everyone can do

07:43.810 --> 07:44.490
what they want.

07:45.730 --> 07:46.730
Just do it well.

07:54.690 --> 07:55.409
Thank you.

07:56.290 --> 07:57.130
Don't get excited.

07:58.010 --> 07:59.490
I allow you join the battalion

08:00.290 --> 08:01.850
because your skills qualify you,

08:02.770 --> 08:04.650
not because I believe your lies.

08:09.410 --> 08:10.770
You are too competent.

08:13.610 --> 08:14.850
A woman like you

08:16.210 --> 08:18.610
joined Yezhou Garrison as a new recruit.

08:20.450 --> 08:22.330
I don't believe there's no hidden story.

08:23.730 --> 08:24.530
The day will come

08:25.810 --> 08:27.290
when your secrets will be uncovered.

08:28.770 --> 08:30.170
What secrets could I possibly have?

08:30.970 --> 08:31.850
You and I were

08:32.770 --> 08:34.049
simply meant to meet each other.

08:51.770 --> 08:52.570
Thank you.

08:57.970 --> 08:59.370
It's too bitter.

09:17.970 --> 09:18.810
Isn't this

09:19.210 --> 09:21.050
the candy I gave him last time?

09:23.770 --> 09:25.170
Using my gift

09:25.250 --> 09:26.450
to repay me?

09:26.730 --> 09:28.050
How stingy.

09:42.040 --> 09:45.960
(The Art of War)

09:50.730 --> 09:51.300
Come in.

10:00.690 --> 10:02.210
Isn't it my dear Miss He?

10:04.610 --> 10:05.570
Stop that nonsense!

10:05.690 --> 10:06.690
What are you saying?

10:09.210 --> 10:10.210
I already know it.

10:10.890 --> 10:11.730
What happened?

10:11.970 --> 10:12.620
Tell me.

10:21.490 --> 10:24.050
I was originally

10:24.090 --> 10:25.770
the daughter of a minor city official.

10:26.090 --> 10:27.010
Due to my beauty,

10:27.370 --> 10:28.890
a local bully took an interest in me.

10:29.210 --> 10:29.810
So I had to

10:30.050 --> 10:31.770
disguise myself as a man and flee home.

10:32.530 --> 10:34.130
Later, with no other choice,

10:34.170 --> 10:35.130
I joined the military.

10:35.690 --> 10:36.290
Mr. Cheng,

10:36.650 --> 10:38.250
you must keep this secret for me.

10:39.970 --> 10:40.770
Do you think

10:40.770 --> 10:42.050
I'm easily fooled?

10:46.210 --> 10:46.770
Fine.

10:47.650 --> 10:49.370
I trust you.

10:50.090 --> 10:50.930
Whatever you say,

10:51.250 --> 10:52.290
I'll believe it.

10:53.090 --> 10:54.050
Thank you, Mr. Cheng.

10:54.650 --> 10:55.610
Take your medicine.

10:59.490 --> 11:00.770
But that fool

11:01.650 --> 11:03.370
is destined to take a fall.

11:18.970 --> 11:19.690
Was it

11:19.690 --> 11:20.570
after I warned you

11:20.970 --> 11:22.450
that you started suspecting Lei Hou?

11:23.850 --> 11:24.890
While investigating you,

11:25.570 --> 11:27.090
we discovered his forged identity

11:27.850 --> 11:28.610
was suspicious.

11:31.490 --> 11:32.250
Then

11:32.250 --> 11:34.010
doesn't that count as a merit for me?

11:38.410 --> 11:39.290
I was wrong.

11:39.850 --> 11:40.690
I won't do it again.

11:41.570 --> 11:42.090
Cut the crap.

11:42.530 --> 11:43.090
Follow me.

11:43.130 --> 11:46.050
(Dungeon)

11:46.050 --> 11:47.050
- Commander.
- Commander.

11:49.690 --> 11:50.890
Save your efforts.

11:54.530 --> 11:55.890
I'll reveal nothing.

12:02.210 --> 12:02.930
Remember this?

12:06.370 --> 12:07.770
My brother's longevity lock.

12:07.930 --> 12:08.610
Xiao Jue,

12:09.170 --> 12:10.330
don't involve my family.

12:10.850 --> 12:12.010
My brother knows nothing.

12:12.250 --> 12:12.890
Spare him.

12:13.530 --> 12:14.130
Do whatever

12:14.170 --> 12:15.370
you want to punish me.

12:15.490 --> 12:16.650
Even kill me if you must.

12:16.650 --> 12:17.370
Please spare him.

12:17.370 --> 12:18.890
You should've anticipated this.

12:19.530 --> 12:20.410
As a death warrior,

12:22.010 --> 12:23.690
how could you cling to false hopes?

12:25.170 --> 12:26.610
Maybe you should've hidden

12:26.650 --> 12:27.890
your family better.

12:28.450 --> 12:29.250
Xiao Jue,

12:31.450 --> 12:32.770
what exactly do you want?

12:33.330 --> 12:34.850
Tell everything you know.

12:37.890 --> 12:38.490
No rush.

12:39.210 --> 12:39.930
I have time.

12:41.210 --> 12:42.170
Take it easy.

12:47.090 --> 12:48.050
What if I refuse?

13:01.930 --> 13:02.770
You can try that.

13:03.450 --> 13:04.010
I guarantee

13:04.010 --> 13:04.650
next time,

13:06.450 --> 13:07.890
I won't bring mere objects.

13:23.730 --> 13:25.370
You truly live up to your name.

13:26.130 --> 13:27.530
Such ruthless methods.

13:28.490 --> 13:29.650
I've learned my lesson.

13:31.050 --> 13:34.810
You seized power shortly after
Xiao Zhongwu and his wife's deaths.

13:35.690 --> 13:37.010
In Que City,

13:37.090 --> 13:39.370
you showed no remorse
while drowning tens of thousands.

13:41.770 --> 13:42.650
No one

13:44.330 --> 13:46.570
is more ruthless than you.

13:57.010 --> 13:58.810
It seems you understand
what kind of man I am.

13:59.130 --> 14:01.010
I never give others second chances.

14:02.130 --> 14:02.690
Wait.

14:05.210 --> 14:06.490
I was originally from Que City.

14:07.930 --> 14:09.170
After the city was flooded,

14:10.010 --> 14:11.410
our home was destroyed,

14:12.810 --> 14:14.010
leaving only me

14:14.090 --> 14:15.490
and my dying younger brother.

14:16.730 --> 14:18.330
When we were desperate,

14:20.090 --> 14:21.170
we met Hu Yuanzhong.

14:22.090 --> 14:23.210
He said he was

14:23.450 --> 14:24.810
a Liehe merchant in Que City.

14:25.570 --> 14:27.090
His wife and children died.

14:28.050 --> 14:29.010
He wanted revenge

14:30.090 --> 14:31.370
and asked if I'd join him.

14:32.130 --> 14:33.370
Then you agreed?

14:34.250 --> 14:35.850
Hatred consumed me then.

14:35.890 --> 14:37.050
I agreed immediately.

14:37.690 --> 14:39.130
He forged me a new identity

14:39.690 --> 14:41.330
to enlist in Yezhou Garrison.

14:42.530 --> 14:43.850
So you joined the battalion

14:44.330 --> 14:46.250
to get close to Commander Xiao?

14:47.250 --> 14:47.780
Yes.

14:48.490 --> 14:49.650
But you are too capable,

14:50.370 --> 14:52.330
as the main challenge
to my joining the battalion.

14:53.130 --> 14:54.210
I bribed Zheng Xuan

14:54.210 --> 14:55.610
and tried to kill you through him.

14:57.050 --> 14:58.290
But you survived

14:58.330 --> 14:59.490
that wolf pack attack.

15:00.010 --> 15:00.690
Recently,

15:01.050 --> 15:02.170
Hu Yuanzhong contacted

15:02.210 --> 15:04.290
Rida Muzi and Liehe forces.

15:04.730 --> 15:06.530
They planned a coordinated attack.

15:08.690 --> 15:09.410
Hu Yuanzhong came

15:09.410 --> 15:10.730
to the barracks first

15:11.890 --> 15:13.410
to inform me.

15:16.410 --> 15:17.170
Every single one

15:17.690 --> 15:18.690
of these things

15:19.530 --> 15:20.450
couldn't be done

15:20.730 --> 15:21.850
by Hu Yuanzhong,

15:21.850 --> 15:22.730
a mere Liehe commoner.

15:23.170 --> 15:24.690
There must be someone more powerful

15:25.170 --> 15:26.770
pulling the strings.

15:27.570 --> 15:28.290
Whether it's him

15:28.690 --> 15:29.690
or the mastermind,

15:30.090 --> 15:31.370
they planned this long ago

15:32.130 --> 15:33.130
with grand ambitions.

15:33.770 --> 15:35.330
I know I'm being used,

15:36.050 --> 15:37.450
but I'll do anything

15:39.250 --> 15:40.010
to get revenge.

15:40.690 --> 15:42.090
Who is the mastermind behind him?

15:43.970 --> 15:44.770
I've never met them.

15:45.490 --> 15:46.530
Hu Yuanzhong has always

15:46.570 --> 15:47.770
handled communications.

15:49.770 --> 15:50.570
Xiao Jue.

15:51.610 --> 15:52.650
I've told you everything

15:52.650 --> 15:53.570
I know.

16:05.280 --> 16:13.380
(Dungeon)

16:14.770 --> 16:16.570
War's cruelty lies

16:17.170 --> 16:18.370
in forcing impossible choices

16:18.890 --> 16:19.450
upon people

16:19.490 --> 16:20.650
everywhere, anytime,

16:21.730 --> 16:22.370
trapping them

16:22.410 --> 16:23.730
in moral dilemmas.

16:28.530 --> 16:29.170
Hou.

16:30.050 --> 16:30.810
Hou.

16:30.970 --> 16:31.610
Brother.

16:32.810 --> 16:33.850
- Hou.
- Brother.

16:34.930 --> 16:35.850
Hou.

16:36.850 --> 16:37.690
Brother.

16:37.970 --> 16:38.730
Hou.

16:39.170 --> 16:40.810
I've missed you so much.

16:42.330 --> 16:43.450
We followed the trail

16:43.690 --> 16:44.410
and found

16:44.450 --> 16:45.050
your brother.

16:45.690 --> 16:46.450
The Commander

16:46.490 --> 16:47.410
ordered us

16:48.410 --> 16:49.410
to treat him well.

16:51.250 --> 16:51.930
Don't think

16:51.970 --> 16:52.970
this redeems your sins.

16:54.490 --> 16:55.930
Those you drowned

16:56.970 --> 16:58.970
will never return.

17:05.010 --> 17:06.569
I never sought forgiveness.

17:08.369 --> 17:09.369
The moment I ordered it,

17:09.410 --> 17:10.170
I knew some crimes

17:11.770 --> 17:12.690
would haunt me

17:14.290 --> 17:15.290
forever.

17:22.329 --> 17:23.569
He's just a Wutuo civilian

17:23.849 --> 17:24.609
born in Que City.

17:25.490 --> 17:26.930
He hid in barracks

17:27.210 --> 17:28.410
and conspired with Rida Muzi.

17:29.610 --> 17:30.330
He couldn't

17:30.330 --> 17:31.170
do these things

17:31.170 --> 17:31.690
on his own.

17:32.410 --> 17:33.530
Are you just letting him go?

17:35.130 --> 17:35.890
Let them leave.

17:51.930 --> 17:52.530
Brother.

17:53.330 --> 17:54.410
Wait here for me.

18:19.390 --> 18:23.130
(Encrypted text)

18:23.130 --> 18:24.730
So that love poem from Hu Yuanzhong

18:25.410 --> 18:26.130
is in your hands.

18:26.690 --> 18:27.850
This is coded communication.

18:28.330 --> 18:28.970
My vengeance

18:29.610 --> 18:30.970
was for those who never returned.

18:33.330 --> 18:33.970
We're even.

18:34.930 --> 18:36.450
But you still owe many others.

19:24.810 --> 19:25.770
What was

19:26.970 --> 19:28.250
the Que City battle really like?

19:31.450 --> 19:32.850
They're right.

19:35.170 --> 19:36.570
I am indeed cold-blooded

19:36.610 --> 19:37.690
and cruel.

19:41.450 --> 19:42.890
The battlefield changes rapidly.

19:44.490 --> 19:45.490
Others may fear

19:46.490 --> 19:47.410
and hesitate.

19:49.450 --> 19:50.650
But a general cannot.

19:52.330 --> 19:53.850
A general must decide.

19:55.970 --> 19:57.810
You have no choice.

20:00.090 --> 20:01.370
If you don't want to tell me,

20:03.570 --> 20:04.450
I won't press.

20:08.330 --> 20:09.490
That night in Que City,

20:14.250 --> 20:15.650
there was a torrential downpour

20:15.730 --> 20:16.810
we'd never seen.

20:40.380 --> 20:43.180
(Wei Camp in Que City)

20:47.770 --> 20:48.330
Commander.

20:50.570 --> 20:51.170
The Wutuo Army

20:51.210 --> 20:52.210
is resting in Que City,

20:52.610 --> 20:53.410
not knowing our army

20:53.450 --> 20:54.410
has reached the gates.

20:55.290 --> 20:56.730
They have 30,000 men.

20:57.850 --> 20:59.370
We only have 3,000 men.

20:59.970 --> 21:02.450
Victory is unlikely
even with surprise tactics.

21:05.450 --> 21:06.290
We all have

21:06.330 --> 21:07.050
a resolve to die.

21:07.450 --> 21:08.290
No turning back.

21:18.610 --> 21:21.370
How far is Que City
from the nearby village?

21:22.290 --> 21:22.970
Ten li.

21:25.450 --> 21:26.570
If we release the reservoir

21:27.690 --> 21:28.610
during the rain,

21:30.450 --> 21:32.410
we will wipe Wutuo Army out.

21:32.890 --> 21:33.970
If the rain doesn't worsen,

21:34.610 --> 21:35.450
the nearby village

21:35.490 --> 21:36.530
will remain safe.

21:38.130 --> 21:40.610
Ride fast and deliver news
to evacuate the villagers.

21:41.170 --> 21:41.770
Also,

21:43.010 --> 21:43.810
deploy rescuers

21:44.090 --> 21:45.170
on standby.

22:37.290 --> 22:37.850
Commander.

22:40.050 --> 22:40.930
The rain intensified.

22:41.250 --> 22:42.210
The water ran wild.

22:42.690 --> 22:43.770
The village was destroyed.

22:45.010 --> 22:46.370
Many people were swept away.

23:39.570 --> 23:40.530
Release the water.

23:57.420 --> 24:02.090
♪Walking through the crowd,
without asking about the future♪

24:04.550 --> 24:09.170
♪Wandering half a lifetime,
solitary as the moon♪

24:10.860 --> 24:17.420
♪Memories pile up,
searching through the endless night♪

24:17.860 --> 24:23.350
♪Longing continues,
feelings are changing♪

24:25.820 --> 24:30.740
♪Just to see you turn,
a fleeting blush in your glance♪

24:32.710 --> 24:38.590
♪Just to tread the snow you described♪

24:39.240 --> 24:45.730
♪The fiercer fate intertwines,
the farther we drift♪

24:46.060 --> 24:52.690
♪It's hard to sever love or hatred♪

24:53.320 --> 24:56.730
♪Before destiny is sealed♪

24:56.840 --> 24:59.810
♪Again and again♪

25:00.390 --> 25:06.340
♪My love rests between your fingers♪

25:06.760 --> 25:10.900
♪Tears carve farewells,
blurring my sight♪

25:10.900 --> 25:13.960
♪Inarticulate lifelong wishes♪

25:14.980 --> 25:20.550
♪Awaiting the spread of moonlight♪

25:37.170 --> 25:37.770
Back then,

25:38.450 --> 25:39.770
you only had 3,000 men.

25:40.490 --> 25:41.570
No other choice existed.

25:42.650 --> 25:43.330
It meant

25:44.290 --> 25:45.410
sending you to die.

25:46.770 --> 25:47.690
You did your best.

25:50.250 --> 25:51.610
I didn't kill them,

25:53.690 --> 25:55.690
but they died because of me.

25:56.700 --> 26:03.330
♪Snow falls on windowsills,
moments fading away♪

26:04.020 --> 26:07.220
♪Before destiny is sealed♪

26:07.510 --> 26:09.490
♪Again and again♪

26:09.490 --> 26:10.130
In the past,

26:11.210 --> 26:12.330
when I was upset,

26:13.570 --> 26:15.010
I wanted someone to hold

26:15.210 --> 26:15.850
and comfort me.

26:18.770 --> 26:19.850
But I had no one.

26:21.450 --> 26:22.570
So I hope

26:25.290 --> 26:26.330
you can have me.

26:26.710 --> 26:31.730
♪Awaiting the spread of moonlight♪

26:37.490 --> 26:38.450
I'm better now.

27:00.810 --> 27:02.130
Miss He's injuries

27:02.170 --> 27:02.970
aren't healed yet.

27:03.810 --> 27:04.730
You made her stand

27:04.810 --> 27:05.930
in the snow all night.

27:06.370 --> 27:08.170
Now, she's relapsed.

27:09.610 --> 27:10.570
Uncle,

27:11.210 --> 27:13.130
have some compassion.

27:15.970 --> 27:16.650
Don't blame him.

27:17.010 --> 27:18.090
I'm recovering well.

27:19.210 --> 27:20.330
Stop making excuses for him.

27:20.810 --> 27:21.570
You two

27:22.130 --> 27:23.050
take advantage of

27:23.090 --> 27:24.730
my medical expertise.

27:25.010 --> 27:27.090
Fine. I'll stop bothering you.

27:28.210 --> 27:29.010
I'll boil the herbs.

27:41.050 --> 27:41.610
Drink this.

27:56.290 --> 27:56.810
Commander.

27:59.370 --> 27:59.890
Come in.

28:05.530 --> 28:06.050
Commander.

28:06.570 --> 28:08.290
(Encrypted text)
Hu Yuanzhong's love poem

28:08.490 --> 28:09.490
has chaotic content.

28:09.810 --> 28:10.730
We analyzed it hard

28:11.050 --> 28:12.130
but found nothing.

28:18.170 --> 28:20.250
There's a bitter smell.

28:28.230 --> 28:29.350
- Ginger soup.
- Ginger soup.

28:32.490 --> 28:33.190
Yes.

28:42.040 --> 28:45.160
(Xiao)

28:51.650 --> 28:52.210
You do it.

29:24.800 --> 29:27.080
(Encrypted text)

29:37.400 --> 29:41.060
(Hai hour on the 5th of the 8th
lunar month, same place, Cimu)

29:45.170 --> 29:46.930
What's going on?

29:47.970 --> 29:50.930
The front of this note
was written in ink,

29:51.730 --> 29:52.330
and the back

29:52.330 --> 29:53.410
with alum solution.

29:54.810 --> 29:55.530
Once dried,

29:55.890 --> 29:56.890
the writing disappears.

29:57.290 --> 29:58.810
But when soaked in ginger soup,

29:59.250 --> 30:00.130
the vanished words

30:00.530 --> 30:01.690
reappear.

30:01.890 --> 30:03.210
This is an old letter.

30:04.210 --> 30:05.690
Perhaps Hu Yuanzhong

30:05.690 --> 30:06.930
didn't fully trust the sender.

30:07.450 --> 30:08.370
That's why he kept it.

30:09.210 --> 30:10.570
Writing with alum solution

30:10.730 --> 30:11.610
to deliver messages

30:12.410 --> 30:13.250
was a method devised

30:13.250 --> 30:14.050
by my father.

30:14.810 --> 30:16.490
He only shared it with close associates.

30:17.410 --> 30:18.450
How did you know that?

30:19.370 --> 30:20.490
(How can I tell you)

30:21.050 --> 30:21.890
(General Xiao)

30:21.890 --> 30:23.010
(personally taught me?)

30:25.530 --> 30:26.370
I

30:26.930 --> 30:28.170
read it in a book.

30:31.610 --> 30:33.290
Commander, are you suggesting

30:34.130 --> 30:34.930
this note comes from

30:34.930 --> 30:36.050
one of our own people?

30:36.450 --> 30:37.610
A traitor in our army?

30:43.690 --> 30:44.410
Where is

30:44.730 --> 30:45.610
this "same place"?

30:46.010 --> 30:47.810
And what does "Cimu"

30:48.090 --> 30:48.810
mean?

30:51.330 --> 30:52.290
"Cimu" refers to "Chai".

30:52.810 --> 30:53.730
My father once had

30:53.970 --> 30:55.490
a long-serving deputy general

30:56.010 --> 30:56.850
named Chai Anxi.

30:57.130 --> 30:57.730
But he died

30:58.370 --> 30:59.290
with my father

30:59.330 --> 31:00.890
at the Mingshui Battlefield.

31:02.250 --> 31:02.970
Unless

31:03.770 --> 31:04.650
he faked his death?

31:06.050 --> 31:07.290
But he was part of your army.

31:07.530 --> 31:08.370
Why did he betray us?

31:09.130 --> 31:09.930
I'm not sure.

31:10.770 --> 31:12.010
His deep knowledge

31:12.050 --> 31:12.930
of our army,

31:13.690 --> 31:15.210
combined with the encrypted text,

31:16.650 --> 31:18.010
makes him the prime suspect.

31:19.250 --> 31:21.050
If this is true,

31:21.850 --> 31:23.130
then his involvement might

31:23.930 --> 31:25.170
explain our defeat at Mingshui.

31:27.050 --> 31:27.650
So we

31:28.530 --> 31:29.370
must track down

31:29.410 --> 31:30.410
Chai Anxi.

31:45.250 --> 31:46.850
The agent you planted

31:47.210 --> 31:49.210
was exposed rather quickly.

31:50.890 --> 31:51.970
Lei Hou and the Liehe tribe

31:52.290 --> 31:53.570
are so useless.

31:54.730 --> 31:55.810
But the real agent

31:56.490 --> 31:57.330
is someone else.

32:01.170 --> 32:02.850
I found him in Que City.

32:22.690 --> 32:23.850
After the flood,

32:24.050 --> 32:25.250
the city became desolate.

32:27.330 --> 32:28.010
I expect

32:28.290 --> 32:30.290
the Xiao Army will soon withdraw.

32:46.330 --> 32:47.050
Are you alright?

32:47.570 --> 32:48.410
He's wounded

32:49.130 --> 32:50.250
and weak.

32:50.490 --> 32:52.290
He's been shadowing
that troop for a while.

32:54.530 --> 32:55.170
Save him first.

33:00.850 --> 33:01.890
(Chai Anxi)
Thank you.

33:02.570 --> 33:03.450
You're not well.

33:04.170 --> 33:04.890
No formalities.

33:07.450 --> 33:08.130
You...

33:08.650 --> 33:09.850
You're a soldier?

33:10.770 --> 33:11.610
I mean no offense.

33:12.330 --> 33:13.130
But earlier,

33:13.170 --> 33:14.410
when dressing your wounds,

33:15.290 --> 33:16.370
I noticed a dagger

33:17.130 --> 33:18.330
engraved with "Xiao".

33:28.130 --> 33:29.450
You're from the Xiao Army?

33:32.570 --> 33:33.170
Relax.

33:33.850 --> 33:34.690
The Xiao Army

33:34.850 --> 33:35.810
is stationed here.

33:36.330 --> 33:37.170
I saw their banner.

33:38.250 --> 33:39.170
I'm just puzzled

33:39.890 --> 33:41.650
why you haven't joined them.

33:49.410 --> 33:50.650
You're not young anymore.

33:51.370 --> 33:52.370
Retiring from battle

33:52.810 --> 33:53.890
is understandable.

33:55.210 --> 33:56.170
I'm no deserter.

34:02.270 --> 34:05.990
(Xiao)

34:06.750 --> 34:08.900
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

34:09.010 --> 34:12.929
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

34:13.100 --> 34:15.050
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

34:15.139 --> 34:20.070
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

34:32.170 --> 34:33.570
♪I've seen the mountains♪

34:33.770 --> 34:35.190
♪And trodden through ice♪

34:35.460 --> 34:38.270
♪Day after day, I venture alone♪

34:38.580 --> 34:39.969
♪Destiny is my creed♪

34:40.030 --> 34:41.429
♪Ideals surge beneath the surface♪

34:41.570 --> 34:43.370
♪Igniting the flame against the winds♪

34:44.570 --> 34:46.040
♪A restless yearning in my soul♪

34:46.210 --> 34:47.500
♪Gazing through the mire♪

34:47.670 --> 34:50.070
♪Who cares about this boundless void♪

34:50.260 --> 34:52.310
♪Charge ahead with blazing fervor♪

34:53.449 --> 34:55.280
♪Stubbornly fighting with my life♪

34:57.240 --> 35:00.160
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

35:00.250 --> 35:02.910
♪There must always be a longing♪

35:03.360 --> 35:08.430
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

35:08.760 --> 35:10.770
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

35:11.080 --> 35:14.730
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

35:14.970 --> 35:16.860
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

35:16.890 --> 35:20.740
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

35:21.090 --> 35:23.030
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

35:23.210 --> 35:27.030
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

35:27.290 --> 35:33.040
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

35:33.930 --> 35:39.400
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪

35:46.550 --> 35:49.470
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

35:49.560 --> 35:52.230
